abstract: >-
  A single-file, offline browser calculator that turns a farmer's own readings
  (afternoon high, morning low, rain gauge, hygrometer) into farm decisions:
  irrigation timing and amount by FAO-56 with its documented missing-data
  procedures, safe alternate wetting and drying for lowland rice, spray-window
  checks, palay drying and storage moisture, heat and cold stress thresholds by
  crop stage, a frost indicator for highland areas, and harvest timing. Every
  result names the published source it derives from, and every calculator names
  the government agency whose guidance takes precedence over it.
keywords:
